OL,3,AFlights grounded across US due to air
OL,4,Atraffic control 'communication issue'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlights have been grounded across the
OL,7,FUS due to an air traffic control
OL,8,F"communication issue", Transport
OL,9,FSecretary Sean Duffy says
OL,11,FUS aviation officials earlier issued an
OL,12,Forder to ground all flights due to
OL,13,F"extraordinary circumstances and for
OL,14,Freasons of safety"
OL,16,FDuffy says the issue hit air traffic
OL,17,Fcontrol centres and "FAA technicians
OL,18,Fare investigating the issue. We will
OL,19,Fprovide immediate updates as we have
OL,20,Fthem"
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
